WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.656 --> 00:00:18.696
looked at all the cameras.

2
00:00:18.716 --> 00:00:23.158
"Cool! I'm going to be on TV!"

3
00:00:23.738 --> 00:00:25.938
The show's host, Tark Zeldo, walked over.

4
00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.659
"Kid Comet!

5
00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:28.639
I'm glad you're here.

6
00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:31.220
We'll have a wonderful interview."

7
00:00:33.156 --> 00:00:34.457
Cozlin and Tark sat down.

8
00:00:36.277 --> 00:00:37.358
Tark looked at a camera.

9
00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:39.339
"Good morning, Delkor!

10
00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:42.400
Kid Comet is with me to talk about her life as a superhero.

11
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.881
So, Kid Comet, what's it like being so powerful?"

12
00:00:46.862 --> 00:00:47.782
Cozlin shrugged.

13
00:00:47.802 --> 00:00:50.763
"It's not a big deal—to me, at least.

14
00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.704
I've been powerful for my entire life!"

15
00:00:53.724 --> 00:00:58.606
"You have a pretty big job, keeping us safe all by yourself," Tark said.

16
00:00:58.626 --> 00:01:02.188
"Do you ever wish Delkor had more superheroes?"

17
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:03.941
Cozlin snorted.

18
00:01:03.961 --> 00:01:05.442
"I don't need help."

19
00:01:07.344 --> 00:01:08.364
Tark's device beeped.

20
00:01:08.384 --> 00:01:14.109
"Oh! I'm getting some breaking news A big robot's invading our city!"

21
00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.110
Cozlin waved a hand.

22
00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.352
"I'll be right back, Tark!"

23
00:01:19.313 --> 00:01:21.715
Zoom! Cozlin was gone in a flash.

24
00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:27.019
Downtown, she saw Delkorians running all over.

25
00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:33.042
Smoke rose from an intersection, and a big robot crushed a bus.

26
00:01:34.222 --> 00:01:36.583
Crunch! Zap!

27
00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:40.324
Lasers shot from Cozlin's hand, destroying the robot.

28
00:01:40.985 --> 00:01:44.446
Ka-boom! Cozlin laughed.

29
00:01:44.966 --> 00:01:50.308
"What a junky—" Another robot threw a car at her.

30
00:01:52.089 --> 00:01:54.730
Zap! Cozlin blasted that robot.

31
00:01:56.151 --> 00:01:58.752
But then another robot appeared and smashed a police car.

32
00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:01.100
"Kid Comet!"

33
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.201
a voice cried.

34
00:02:03.121 --> 00:02:04.302
It was Detective Borzon.

35
00:02:05.162 --> 00:02:07.723
He was hiding behind a tree with several other Delkorians.

36
00:02:08.763 --> 00:02:09.784
Cozlin hurried over.

37
00:02:09.804 --> 00:02:12.725
"Is that your car, Detective?

38
00:02:13.385 --> 00:02:14.306
It looks great!

39
00:02:14.846 --> 00:02:16.006
I like all the dents."

40
00:02:16.927 --> 00:02:17.947
The detective frowned.

41
00:02:17.967 --> 00:02:21.869
"Ha-ha. This is serious, Kid Comet."

42
00:02:23.029 --> 00:02:23.849
Cozlin shrugged.

43
00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:26.711
"I know it seems serious, Detective.

44
00:02:26.951 --> 00:02:28.031
But I can handle it."

45
00:02:29.052 --> 00:02:29.972
She scratched her head.

46
00:02:31.068 --> 00:02:32.169
"I'm confused though.

47
00:02:32.729 --> 00:02:34.950
Tark Zeldo said there was one robot.

48
00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.591
I've seen three."

49
00:02:36.611 --> 00:02:40.072
"At first there was one," someone said.

50
00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:42.013
"But—" "Look!"

51
00:02:42.493 --> 00:02:43.674
Detective Borzon pointed.

52
00:02:44.714 --> 00:02:45.755
Cozlin spun around.

53
00:02:46.675 --> 00:02:48.156
One of the robots ate a car.

54
00:02:49.136 --> 00:02:51.057
Strange sounds came from inside the robot.

55
00:02:51.757 --> 00:02:54.038
Then a hatch popped open on the back of the robot.

56
00:02:55.039 --> 00:02:56.239
A new robot popped out!

57
00:02:59.308 --> 00:03:02.511
Down the street she saw another robot eat a car and make a new robot.

58
00:03:05.474 --> 00:03:06.875
Cozlin flew high into the air.

59
00:03:07.716 --> 00:03:09.818
She looked down and gasped.

60
00:03:11.419 --> 00:03:12.760
Robots were everywhere!

61
00:03:19.887 --> 00:03:21.168
mad!" Roxy said.

62
00:03:22.289 --> 00:03:25.552
Roxy and her friends were walking home from school, talking about their day.

63
00:03:26.764 --> 00:03:30.287
During recess an older kid had made fun of Terrell for wearing glasses.

64
00:03:30.307 --> 00:03:33.429
"I was mad too," Mara said.

65
00:03:33.449 --> 00:03:35.830
"But at least he apologized."

66
00:03:36.631 --> 00:03:38.812
"He seemed pretty sorry," Jack said.

67
00:03:40.033 --> 00:03:40.834
Roxy frowned.

68
00:03:40.854 --> 00:03:44.596
"He only apologized because he got in trouble.

69
00:03:45.437 --> 00:03:47.278
A teacher had to talk to him first."

70
00:03:48.159 --> 00:03:48.939
Terrell shrugged.

71
00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.261
"It's not a big deal, Roxy."

72
00:03:53.102 --> 00:03:55.064
Jack and Mara turned left to go to their homes.

73
00:03:56.852 --> 00:03:58.253
Roxy and Terrell walked together.

74
00:03:58.273 --> 00:04:02.595
"I don't think you should forgive the kid, Terrell," Roxy said.

75
00:04:02.615 --> 00:04:05.816
"When people are bad, they're always bad."

76
00:04:05.836 --> 00:04:09.898
"That sounds kind of harsh," Terrell said.

77
00:04:09.918 --> 00:04:12.079
"Remember Dr.

78
00:04:12.299 --> 00:04:13.579
Odd, the robot maker?"

79
00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.140
Terrell nodded.

80
00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:20.202
"He was just released from prison for good behavior," Roxy said.

81
00:04:20.222 --> 00:04:23.884
"But there's no way he's a good guy now."

82
00:04:26.192 --> 00:04:28.574
"Maybe he changed," Terrell said.

83
00:04:28.594 --> 00:04:31.557
"No way," Roxy repeated.

84
00:04:31.577 --> 00:04:35.220
"It's only a matter of time before he commits more crimes."

85
00:04:38.463 --> 00:04:39.884
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

86
00:04:44.308 --> 00:04:45.489
Bloom! What's wrong?"

87
00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:47.771
The mayor looked scared.

88
00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:49.813
"We need help, Rocket Girl!

89
00:04:50.253 --> 00:04:52.976
There's a huge monster in downtown Metro City!"
